OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of terror attack plot  
OL,4,Aat migrant hotel                       
OL,6,FAn alleged white supremist has been    
OL,7,Ffound guilty of plotting to firebomb a 
OL,8,Fmigrant hotel in Hull and possessing   
OL,9,Fweapons for terrorist purposes.        
OL,11,FMikka Lee Anderson, 24, of Morpeth     
OL,12,FStreet, Hull, had planned to attack the
OL,13,FRoyal Hotel using petrol bombs, a jury 
OL,14,Fat Newcastle Crown Court was told.     
OL,16,FHe was arrested after meeting a        
OL,17,Fwould-be accomplice in February who    
OL,18,Flater reported him to police.          
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
