OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of terror attack plot  
OL,4,Aat migrant hotel                       
OL,6,FAnderson had denied preparing an act of
OL,7,Fterrorism, including making Molotov    
OL,8,Fcocktails, conducting reconnaissance at
OL,9,Fthe hotel and possessing knives and    
OL,10,Fother weapons for terrorist purposes.  
OL,11,FHe was convicted on both counts.       
